{"reviews":[{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-0","r":4.0,"t":"4 Stars But I\u2019m Not Ordering Again","x":"Well\u2026 I tried them. Not a fan. Absolutely no disrespect to those who assembled these or shipped these, or who enjoy these or who are used to these\u2026 but I couldn\u2019t get past the strange evolution of flavors, and the fact that although it is licorice root, it\u2019s a stick I was sucking on and chewing on. A stick. I\u2019m going to hold on to these in my freezer if \u201cstuff\u201d hits the fan with this world.. I\u2019ll at least know I have a pound of sticks/licorice root to help me out.","h":43,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Thes are the real deal","x":"These are the first thing I thought of when I decided to quit smoking I didn't want to put chemicals or nicotine substitutes into my body. I was thrilled to find them online I'd only ever seen them sold on the street. They've been a blessing! A little less than a week in and almost no cravings! \ud83e\udd1e\ud83c\udffe\ud83e\udd1e\ud83c\udffe\ud83e\udd1e\ud83c\udffe\ud83e\udd1e\ud83c\udffe","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Not too bad","x":"It tastes like hell at first but it\u2019s helped me stop vaping","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Nostalgia","x":"Was a bit worried that they'd be huge but there were different sizes. Delivery was fast. First bite took me back to child hood. Ordered these to help me stop smoking. Wish me luck","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Not disappointed","x":"I put them in a freezer bag even though they came perfect in there own bag but still great just like I remember when I had these as a kid.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-5","r":4.0,"t":"Good","x":"Since moving from NY to VA can't really find these unless we go to Richmond VA to get them. The stick are good for the price, just wish it wasn't so many thick ones.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Good good good","x":"I used to get these back in the days Love em good taste keeps breath fresh helps with my cravings","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-7","r":4.0,"t":"Could use more mint even if it was just a powder","x":"Not much mint flavor but still good chewing sticks.  Ps. If u don\u2019t like chewing sticks u wont like these...","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Choose Chews","x":"Many benefits: freshens breath, cleans and strengthens teeth, curbs smoking and appetite. Thanks!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-9","r":2.0,"t":"I really wanted to like these\u2026","x":"I had been looking for something to chew on, besides food, at night and thought these would be different. They sure were! I read a lot of reviews and many of them said you had to get use to them but I just couldn\u2019t get past chewing on a stick until it frayed at the end. I ended up returning them. Yuk.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-10","r":3.0,"t":"Thick","x":"I got these for my spouse because he is doing the whole immediate fasting and gum apparently messes with your fasting. The are kinda think but he cuts them down and chews on them. He likes them.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Love them","x":"I wanted to try these for a long time. I was skeptical about them but it's been about a month and I love them. Planning on buying more eventually.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Just like the good old days.","x":"Outstanding Product. I hadn't had one in 35+ years And they taste the same \ud83d\ude01 Great job. They help me drive long distances I use to chew straws but those have many dangerous chemicals in them. This is all natural and taste great.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"Best thing to have in your travel bag.","x":"Had a fascination with shoe sticks ever since I was a kid and seeing the Wu-Tang Clan with them. But knowing that it has a rich history in Africa and other countries as a way of oral hygiene is a positive as well.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-14","r":3.0,"t":"Not the sellers fault just my personal opinion and shipping was very fast","x":"They were okay just not what I expected so I pretty much have a bag that I'll never use again but you learn from your mistakes it's not their fault it's just not what I was expecting it to be","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-15","r":3.0,"t":"They taste terrible.","x":"Next time I'll go with peppermint or a minty flavor.  Very bad idea to think strawberry was a good selection.  Aside from that I'm happy with the results.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-16","r":5.0,"t":"It is the best!","x":"I like the taste of the sweet sap that comes from the sticks. I liked these things since I was a child.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Its been 24yrs since I had these","x":"My uncle put me on when I was young I love it and yes it helps whiten teeth but also surprises appetite","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-18","r":4.0,"t":"Exactly what they say they are, but not for me","x":"It\u2019s exactly what\u2019s promised. Minty sticks. But unfortunately they\u2019re not for me. I didn\u2019t like the texture of the bark that was getting stuck in between my teeth. And a couple of times little bits of it would break off and get stuck in the back of my throat. If it wouldn\u2019t have been for that, they would be perfect. But it\u2019s wood lol. Cant really expect too much from it xD If you don\u2019t think that would bother you, then these are for you!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2023"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-19","r":2.0,"t":"Strawberry was a mistake","x":"I think they're fun to chew, but the taste is awful. Idk why I thought strawberry would be a good flavor, it's not. At this point, I'd rather chew on plain stick flavor haha. I don't recommend strawberry at all.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-20","r":5.0,"t":"They like them","x":"The person I ordered them for is a smoker. I just want to help them to quite","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value","x":"Great value and amount of sticks you get is AWESOME.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-22","r":1.0,"t":"Gross","x":"I wasted my money because the taste was horrible.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-23","r":4.0,"t":"Not bad","x":"More flavor would be better but not bad at all","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B07NYS5DNQ-24","r":1.0,"t":"NO FAVOR","x":"These chew sticks are suppose to have a peppermint favor, not only do they do not have a peppermint favor you can not even smell a scent on them......","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say these sticks help them stop smoking or vaping and curb cravings.","cites":[2,3,4,7,9]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe a nostalgic, childhood-memory appeal and say the taste matches what they remember.","cites":[4,5,7,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the sticks too thick or the flavor not as expected, and a few would not repurchase.","cites":[1,6,10,11,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention breath-freshening and oral-hygiene benefits.","cites":[7,9,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the taste takes getting used to or wish for more mint flavor.","cites":[3,8,10]}]},"qa":[]}